description	"Mandalorian Neo-Crusader Airborne

A Neocrusader equipped with a jetpack and heavy armor, as well as a deathwish for himself but even more for his enemies.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- 5% Faster RoF
- Mandalorian Ceremonial Blade
-- Red/Cyan Style
-- Saber Defense (1)
- Thermal Grenades (5)
- Vambrace Microrockets (Whistling Birds)
-- 50%- Damage

^8Attributes:
- Assemble (1)
- Blast Armor
- 15% less Kb Taken
- 25% slower Skill CD
- Fuel Regen (1)
- Binoculars ^3[CS4]
- Tracking Beacon
- Environmental Protection (1)
- Beskar (1)
- Tracking Darts (4) ^3[CS3]"